# Cron job configuration for Quant Dashboard Daily Reports
# 
# This file shows how to configure a cron job to run the daily report generator
# at 8:00 PM (20:00) every day.
#
# To install this cron job:
# 1. Edit this file and adjust the path to your project directory
# 2. Run: crontab -e
# 3. Add the following line (adjust the path to your project):
#
# 0 20 * * * cd /path/to/quant-dashboard && /path/to/venv/bin/python cron/generate_report.py >> cron/cron.log 2>&1
#
# Or if using the system Python:
# 0 20 * * * cd /path/to/quant-dashboard && python3 cron/generate_report.py >> cron/cron.log 2>&1
#
# To verify the cron job is installed:
# crontab -l
#
# To view cron logs:
# tail -f cron/cron.log

# Example cron entry (uncomment and adjust paths):
# 0 20 * * * cd /home/user/quant-dashboard && /home/user/quant-dashboard/venv/bin/python cron/generate_report.py >> cron/cron.log 2>&1

